title: Happily Ever After
priority: 1
max-visits: 1
tags: event
new-page: true
view-if: happily_ever_after_event = 0 and 0 = 1
on-arrival: happily_ever_after_event = 1; prince_s_resident = 1

The cocktail gossip circuit has a new figure to hound.  A Morrocan Prince Sayyed, who is known worldwide as simply "S" has decided to move to Mikasa.  He is looking to settle down after a heroic career.  He did humanitarian work in disaster zones, lead rebels in warzones and gave a voice to the powerless all over the world.  In the course of his work he has entered into multiple simultaneous political marriages, a rarely used legal right of the Moroccan royalty.  But his father on his deathbed decided to disinherit S; although S was not the heir his father had enough of his insufferable righteousness.  Losing his royal status meant S had to annul all but one of his marriages.  To the shock of the Docks Highside crowd, he has apparently made his choice for love not fortune.  S and his remaining wife have decided to settle down in Mikasa and raise their children while running a foster home for otherworlders.  It's all simply too much, he acts like he's better then everyone.

Oh and his bride... who was she?

- @ess_bride_oligarch: Outside oligarch
- @ess_bride_waystation: Another waystation
- @ess_bride_local: Local
- @ess_bride_clan: Clan of the Mother

