Apparently S's bride is some corporate executive who has decided to leave all the trappings of wealth behind.  The rumors naturally jump to assuming she was forced out but apparently she is still quite well respected.

The megacorporations assume someone is plotting something and have become more hostile towards the city government and towards each other.

