Apparently S's bride is some "archaelogist" from the waystation Hyacinth who has explored the otherworld and is fluent in Ruukish.  Naturally the pair are accused of everything from kidnapping otherworld children to consorting with demons.  The couple adeptly avoids any tabloids looking for a comment but does help open up dialogues between universities and between universes.

