Apparently S's bride is some girl he knew since childhood.  They say she was an orphan who was living in the streets but street rats dont marry princes.  The judgemental tongues assume this bridge is a gold digger, or perhaps even black widow.  The foolish laborers find it a heartwarming tale however.

However among less judgemental crowds, S does serve as a reminder that rich or poor we are all humans.  Well except those of us who are elves or whatever but you know what I mean.

